.TH COSMIC-SETTINGS-DAEMON 1 August 2026 cosmic-settings-daemon 0.1.0 User Commands
.SH NAME
cosmic-settings-daemon \- D-Bus settings service for the COSMIC desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /usr/bin/cosmic-settings-daemon
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cosmic-settings-daemon
provides COSMIC settings and state services over D-Bus. It watches
configuration changes and handles audio, display brightness, input-source,
and accessibility services.
.PP
The service acquires the D-Bus name
.B com.system76.CosmicSettingsDaemon
and exports its primary object at
.BR /com/system76/CosmicSettingsDaemon .
.SH OPTIONS
This program has no command-line options.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.B RUST_LOG
selects the log level supported by the Rust
.B env_logger
backend.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dbus-daemon (1)
